s/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob6ysfKz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobiwS7dt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島　DAY1"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobX4p5WZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobZi2QJW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobf1llM1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobpQdJkf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob9Lxkm3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島　DAY2"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はとにかく皆さんとの距離がかなり近いので、これからライブに来てくださる方は是非タオルやペンライト持ってきてくださいね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かなり見えてます＾　＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は千葉で待っています"}], "source": "official"}